WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:03.000
OBSERVE / Move the camera into observation pose

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000
SEARCH / Rotate the base and search for the cube

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:07.000
LOCATE / Stop and localize before approaching

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:09.000
APPROACH / Approach the planned parking point

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:10.000
ARM POSE / Prepare the arm for a fresh grasp

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:12.000
REACQUIRE / Reacquire the cube and approach with the arm

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:28.000
GRASP + LIFT / Close the gripper and lift the cube

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:36.000
COMPLETE / Release the cube and finish the run

